  "contract": [
    "Hawkeye 800358 reads 'enemies within 30 yds affected by your Hunting Shot'. Effect 0 is",
    "SPELL_EFFECT_APPLY_AREA_AURA_ENEMY carrying SPELL_AURA_PERIODIC_TRIGGER_SPELL 801192 (3 s tick, 30 yd",
    "radius); effect 1 is SPELLMOD_DURATION +9999 ms on the Hunting Shot class mask, whose own records have",
    "no duration. aura_ascension_ranger_hawkeye answers the area-target check: an enemy without the Ranger's",
    "Hunting Shot aura (chain 801191) never receives effect 0, while the Ranger herself must still be",
    "accepted or effect 1 never reaches her and the mark expires at once. Expected: with Hawkeye learned and",
    "nothing marked, neither golem is hit by 801192 over two ticks; after Hunting Shot 801191 marks one",
    "golem, that golem is hit by 801192 and carries the Hawkeye aura, while the unmarked golem 25 yd away is",
    "never hit and carries no Hawkeye aura."
